{"product_id":"the-secret-laws-of-attraction-the-effortless-way-to-get-the-relationship-you-want","title":"The Secret Laws of Attraction: The Effortless Way to Get the Relationship You Want","description":"\u003cp\u003eUse these laws of attraction to effortlessly attain your heart's desire.“If you don't need it, you are more likely to attract it.” If our emotional needs are unmet, we repel what we most desire. When we've fulfilled our needs--such as the need to be cherished, the need to be heard, and the need for harmony--we are naturally attractive to potential love interests.“Like attracts like.”When we are fully living our core values, we effortlessly attract others with similar values.It sounds simple. The trick is learning how to apply these laws in your everyday life--and international bestselling author and noted life coach Talane Miedaner shows you how. This easy-to-follow guide provides a comprehensive quiz to help you identify your top four emotional needs and includes step-by-step instructions on how to meet those needs. Once you start embracing your passion and living your dreams, you instantly become more attractive to others. It's truly the “effortless” way to find and keep the love of your life.\"Talane is a masterful life coach--she is the living embodiment of the laws of attraction.\"--Sandy Vilas, MCC, CEO of Coach U, Inc.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 150 x 226\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Talane Miedaner\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780071543750\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45748967604377,"sku":"16RC-19780071543750","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68d66a24ef90a_The_Secret_Laws_of_Attraction-_The_Effortless_Way_to_Get_the_Relationship_You_Want_Talane_Miedaner.jpg?v=1758895815","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-secret-laws-of-attraction-the-effortless-way-to-get-the-relationship-you-want","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}